      "name": "DV History",
      "settings": {
        "title": "The DV History",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/DV_History.png",
        "text": "<p>Our roots stem from the renowned DV Group, a company began its journey more than 6 decades ago was founded by Shri Dahyabhai S. Patel, Shri Vithaldas H. Patel & Shri Ranchhoddas H. Patel in the thriving spices market of Madhupura in Ahmedabad – Gujarat. </p><p>The journey started as humble traders of spices and dry-fruits with a state wide customer network reaching the last mile small towns. </p><p>As a family driven company, with strong perseverance of its members, the group today ascended from being modest traders into becoming a leading exporter, wholesaler and manufacturer of superior quality spices, dry-fruits & tea. </p><p>With focus on food safety as its paradigm, the group has developed a reputation for exceptional quality and outstanding service. As a result, DV products are essential ingredients in flavouring some of the world’s popular food brands.</p>",
        "cta_text": "Know more",
        "cta_link": "",
        "gap": 28,
        "padding-block-start": 48,
        "padding-block-end": 48
      }
